# Tracer: eval checks source-expression WD before executing an algorithm.
# Before (wrongly accepted):
# algo domain_identity(x N) N by cases:
#     case x = x: x
# eval domain_identity(-1)
# Former behavior: exit 0 even though -1 is outside N.
#
# Now: valid calls evaluate; the same invalid call is an executable negative
# fixture under examples/test_statements/negative/eval_stmt/outside-algo-domain.lit.
algo domain_identity(x N) N by cases:
    case x = x: x
eval domain_identity(0)
eval domain_identity(2) + 1

# Boundary: source WD is checked before execution; only a successful exact
# computation publishes the source/result equality.
# Evidence: target/release/litex -lang en -strict -f examples/stmt_nodes/command/eval_source_domain.lit
# Tests: execute::statement_boundary_tests::eval_checks_source_domain_before_rewrite_or_execution.
